Error [E1803]: application authority is undecided for `Env, Mem.Alloc, Panic`
 Why: required_effects=Env, Mem.Alloc, Panic; granted_effects=none; denied_effects=none; denied_required_effects=none; undecided_effects=Env, Mem.Alloc, Panic; authority=application default
 Fix: declare the effect in `authority.holds.allow`, or approve it before execution in an interactive terminal
